{
  "argument_loc": "Unspecified",
  "description": "Sets thermal vision mode for currently used camera. This command only works with [[camCreate]] created camera that is currently the main camera for the player (see Example 2).",
  "effect_loc": "Unspecified",
  "examples": [
    "<sqf>true setCamUseTI 1;</sqf>",
    "''Predator'' vision:\n<sqf>\n_cam = \"camera\" camCreate [0, 0, 0];\n_cam camSetTarget player;\n_cam camSetRelPos [0, 1, 1.5];\n_cam cameraEffect [\"Internal\", \"Back\"];\n_cam camCommit 0;\ntrue setCamUseTI 7;\n</sqf>"
  ],
